cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "GroMo: growing modules for PyTorch"
abstract: >-
  GroMo is a Python package that provides a set of tools for PyTorch users to
  train neural networks that grow in size and complexity as they learn.
